        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo wakaondoka, wakakimbia kungali giza bado, wakaziacha hema zao, na farasi zao, na punda zao, na kimo chao vile vile kama kilivyokuwa, wakakimbia wapate kujiponya nafsi zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
