            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalme akaondoka usiku, akawaambia watumishi wake, Sasa nitawaonyesha ninyi walivyotutendea Washami. Wanajua ya kuwa tuna njaa; basi wametoka kituoni, ili kujificha kondeni, wakisema Watakapotoka mjini, tutawakamata hai; tena tutapata kuingia mjini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
