        {
          "text": "Naye mfalme akamweka yule akida, ambaye alitegemea mkono wake, awasimamie watu langoni; na watu wakamkanyaga langoni, akafa; kama alivyosema yule mtu wa Mungu, aliyenena hapo mfalme alipomshukia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.17",
